window.TH_CONTENT["fil"] = {"Garbage truck, in an official bag":"Garbage truck, sa official bag","Recycling truck on the same route, free":"Recycling truck sa parehong ruta, libre","Blue food-waste bucket at the back of the garbage truck":"Asul na balde ng tirang pagkain sa likod ng garbage truck","Recycling truck, packed separately":"Recycling truck, nakabalot nang hiwalay","Book a pickup with the cleaning squad":"Mag-book ng pickup sa cleaning squad","Ask the cleaning squad first":"Magtanong muna sa cleaning squad","Bottles, cans, containers, plastics, styrofoam, small electronics":"Bote, lata, lalagyan, plastik, styrofoam, maliliit na electronics","Paper, clean clothes, clean plastic bags, books":"Papel, malinis na damit, malinis na plastic bag, libro","Batteries, bulbs and tubes, cooking oil, pesticide containers":"Battery, bombilya at fluorescent, mantika, lalagyan ng pesticide","Free for households. Call your district cleaning squad (or 1999) at least one day before. Pickup Mon–Sat, none on Sunday. Many squads ask you to put it out after 9 pm.":"Libre para sa mga bahay. Tawagan ang cleaning squad ng district mo (o 1999) kahit isang araw bago. May pickup Lun–Sab, wala tuwing Linggo. Maraming squad ang nagpapalabas nito pagkalipas ng 9 pm.","No official rule found yet — ask before throwing it out.":"Wala pang nahanap na opisyal na patakaran — magtanong muna bago itapon.","Small":"Maliit","Medium":"Katamtaman","Large":"Malaki","General household trash must go in an official bag (Taipei per-bag fee).":"Ang ordinaryong basura ng bahay ay dapat nasa official bag (sa Taipei, ang bayad ay kasama sa presyo ng bag).","Recyclables and food waste, sorted as required, are collected free — no official bag needed.":"Libre ang koleksyon ng recyclable at tirang pagkain na naka-sort nang tama — hindi kailangan ng official bag.","Fill only up to the line printed on the bag. About 30% above the line is left for tying. Tie it with the handles, rope or tape. Do not squeeze it so hard that it tears or leaks.":"Punuin lang hanggang sa linyang nakaimprenta sa bag. Ang mga 30% sa itaas ng linya ay para sa pagtali. Itali gamit ang hawakan, tali o tape. Huwag itong siksikin nang sobra para hindi mapunit o tumulo.","New Taipei official bags (including their dual-use and all-purpose bags) are also accepted in Taipei.":"Tinatanggap din sa Taipei ang official bag ng New Taipei (kasama ang dual-use at all-purpose bag nila).","Bags 33 L and up are flat-top; 25 L and under have handles. Real bags carry an anti-counterfeit label.":"Flat top ang mga bag na 33 L pataas; may hawakan ang 25 L pababa. May anti-counterfeit na label ang totoong bag.","Not using an official bag can be fined from NT$1,200.":"Puwedeng multahan mula NT$1,200 kapag hindi gumamit ng official bag.","Dual-use bags are the shopping bags sold at supermarkets and chain convenience stores. You can only get them with a purchase (no packs, no buying them alone). After shopping, use them as official garbage bags.":"Ang dual-use bag ay ang shopping bag na binebenta sa supermarket at chain na convenience store. Makukuha mo lang ito kapag may binili ka (walang pack, hindi puwedeng bilhin nang mag-isa). Pagkatapos mamili, gamitin ito bilang official na garbage bag.","Suggestion, not a rule: pick the smallest bag that fits what you actually throw out, by volume and weight, with room left to tie it. Small amounts thrown out often: start with 3 L or 5 L. A few days of household trash: compare 14 L and 25 L. More than that: 33 L and up. A photo of one item cannot tell how big your whole bag needs to be.":"Mungkahi, hindi patakaran: piliin ang pinakamaliit na bag na kasya sa talagang itatapon mo, ayon sa dami at bigat, na may natitirang lugar para itali. Kaunti at madalas magtapon: magsimula sa 3 L o 5 L. Basura ng bahay sa ilang araw: ikumpara ang 14 L at 25 L. Mas marami pa: 33 L pataas. Hindi masasabi ng litrato ng isang bagay kung gaano kalaki ang bag na kailangan mo.","Plastic bottle (PET)":"Plastik na bote (PET)","Empty and rinse":"Ubusin ang laman at banlawan","Pour out what is left and give it a quick rinse.":"Ibuhos ang natitirang laman at banlawan nang mabilis.","Flatten it":"Pipiin ito","Squash it to save space.":"Pipiin para makatipid sa espasyo.","Take off the cap if you can":"Tanggalin ang takip kung kaya","Caps can go to recycling too.":"Puwede ring i-recycle ang takip.","Hand it to the crew on the recycling truck that follows the garbage truck (Tue / Thu / Sat). Free — no special bag needed.":"Ibigay sa crew ng recycling truck na kasunod ng garbage truck (Mar / Huw / Sab). Libre — hindi kailangan ng espesyal na bag.","Drink / food can (aluminum, tin)":"Lata ng inumin / pagkain (aluminum, tin)","Spray or pressure cans are different — see \"Spray can\".":"Iba ang spray o pressure can — tingnan ang \"Spray can\".","Glass bottle / jar":"Bote / garapon na salamin","Empty and rinse — do not flatten":"Ubusin ang laman at banlawan — huwag pipiin","Glass only needs rinsing.":"Banlawan lang ang salamin.","Keep it whole":"Panatilihing buo","Hand it over unbroken so nobody gets cut.":"Iabot nang buo para walang masugatan.","Broken glass is handled differently — see \"Broken glass\".":"Iba ang pag-aasikaso sa basag na salamin — tingnan ang \"Basag na salamin\".","Drink carton / juice box":"Karton ng inumin / juice box","Carton":"Karton","3-D recyclable (Tue/Thu/Sat suggested).":"3-D na recyclable (mungkahi: Mar/Huw/Sab).","Straw and its wrapper":"Straw at ang balot nito","The current official FAQ does not say where straws go. Older city leaflets say general trash; please confirm with your cleaning squad.":"Hindi sinasabi ng kasalukuyang opisyal na FAQ kung saan itatapon ang straw. Sabi ng mas lumang leaflet ng lungsod, ordinaryong basura ito; pakikumpirma sa cleaning squad mo.","Take out the straw":"Tanggalin ang straw","Check what is left inside first.":"Tingnan muna kung may natira sa loob.","Plastic drink cup (bubble tea)":"Plastik na baso ng inumin (milk tea)","Drink, ice and pearls":"Inumin, yelo at pearls","Pour the drink away. Pearls and other toppings are food.":"Itapon ang inumin. Pagkain ang pearls at ibang toppings.","Not listed item by item by the city.":"Hindi isa-isang nakalista ng lungsod.","Plastic cup":"Plastik na baso","A container: 3-D recyclable.":"Lalagyan ito: 3-D na recyclable.","Sealing film and straw":"Sealing film at straw","The current official FAQ does not say where these go. Older leaflets say general trash; please confirm.":"Hindi sinasabi ng kasalukuyang opisyal na FAQ kung saan ito itatapon. Sabi ng mas lumang leaflet, ordinaryong basura ito; pakikumpirma.","Empty it":"Ubusin ang laman","Pour out the drink and toppings.":"Ibuhos ang inumin at toppings.","Separate the parts":"Paghiwa-hiwalayin ang mga bahagi","Peel off the film and take out the straw.":"Tanggalin ang film at ang straw.","Paper cup":"Papel na baso","The city FAQ lists paper meal boxes and drink cartons as 3-D recyclables but does not name paper cups. We show the paper-container rule; please confirm with your cleaning squad.":"Nakalista sa FAQ ng lungsod ang papel na lunch box at karton ng inumin bilang 3-D na recyclable, pero walang binanggit na papel na baso. Ipinapakita namin ang patakaran para sa papel na lalagyan; pakikumpirma sa cleaning squad mo.","Paper container: 3-D recyclable, not flat paper.":"Papel na lalagyan: 3-D na recyclable, hindi patag na papel.","Plastic lid":"Plastik na takip","Plastic: 3-D recyclable.":"Plastik: 3-D na recyclable.","Plastic / paper lunch box":"Plastik / papel na lunch box","Leftover food":"Tirang pagkain","Box":"Lalagyan","Paper or plastic meal box: 3-D recyclable.":"Papel o plastik na lunch box: 3-D na recyclable.","Scrape out the food":"Simutin ang pagkain","Leftover food goes to food waste.":"Ang tirang pagkain ay sa food waste.","Let it dry":"Patuyuin","Wet recyclables can make other items dirty.":"Puwedeng makadumi sa ibang recyclable ang basang recyclable.","Wooden lunch boxes are NOT recyclable — general trash.":"HINDI nire-recycle ang kahoy na lunch box — ordinaryong basura ito.","Styrofoam":"Styrofoam","Keep it clean":"Panatilihing malinis","Only clean styrofoam is recycled.":"Malinis na styrofoam lang ang nire-recycle.","Sponge / foam filling (泡棉) is not recyclable.":"Hindi nire-recycle ang sponge / foam na palaman (泡棉).","Fruit foam net":"Foam net ng prutas","Old phone / small electronics":"Lumang phone / maliliit na electronics","Delete your data":"Burahin ang data mo","Factory-reset phones and computers first.":"I-factory reset muna ang phone at computer.","Take out batteries you can remove":"Tanggalin ang battery na puwedeng tanggalin","Batteries are recycled separately.":"Hiwalay na nire-recycle ang battery.","Other hard plastic / metal":"Ibang matigas na plastik / metal","Coconut / durian shell":"Bao ng niyog / balat ng durian","Not food waste":"Hindi ito tirang pagkain","Do not mix them into food waste. Collect them separately.":"Huwag ihalo sa tirang pagkain. Ipunin nang hiwalay.","Hand them to the recycling truck crew, separate from food waste.":"Ibigay sa crew ng recycling truck, hiwalay sa tirang pagkain.","Paper, newspaper, boxes":"Papel, diyaryo, kahon","Keep it dry":"Panatilihing tuyo","Only paper that can be laid flat and is clean and dry.":"Papel lang na puwedeng ilatag, malinis at tuyo.","Flatten boxes":"Ilatag ang mga kahon","Remove tape and flatten.":"Tanggalin ang tape at ilatag.","Bundle and tie":"Pagsama-samahin at itali","Tie paper into a bundle so it does not fly away.":"Itali ang papel nang magkakasama para hindi lumipad.","Paper cups, meal boxes and drink cartons are containers (3-D), not flat paper. Greasy paper, tissues, laminated glossy paper and photo paper are general trash.":"Ang papel na baso, lunch box at karton ng inumin ay lalagyan (3-D), hindi patag na papel. Ordinaryong basura ang papel na may mantika, tissue, makintab na laminated na papel at photo paper.","Hand it to the crew on the recycling truck that follows the garbage truck (Mon / Fri). Free — no special bag needed.":"Ibigay sa crew ng recycling truck na kasunod ng garbage truck (Lun / Biy). Libre — hindi kailangan ng espesyal na bag.","Clean old clothes":"Malinis na lumang damit","Wash and dry":"Labhan at patuyuin","Only clean, dry clothes are accepted.":"Malinis at tuyong damit lang ang tinatanggap.","Bag them":"Ilagay sa bag","Put them in any bag.":"Ilagay sa kahit anong bag.","Towels, socks, underpants, bedding, curtains and torn or smelly clothes are general trash.":"Ordinaryong basura ang tuwalya, medyas, panloob, kumot at sapin, kurtina, at punit o mabahong damit.","Clean plastic bag":"Malinis na plastic bag","Must be clean":"Dapat malinis","No oil, soup or blood.":"Walang mantika, sabaw o dugo.","Stuff bags into one bag":"Pagsama-samahin sa isang bag","Snack and chip bags (shiny, mixed material) are general trash.":"Ordinaryong basura ang balot ng snack at chips (makintab, halo-halong materyales).","Old books":"Lumang libro","Tie them apart from other paper":"Itali nang hiwalay sa ibang papel","200 books or more: arrange a time with the cleaning squad.":"200 libro o higit pa: makipag-ayos ng oras sa cleaning squad.","Fruit & vegetable scraps":"Balat at tira ng prutas at gulay","Drain it":"Patuluin","Drain the water before you take it out.":"Patuluin ang tubig bago ilabas.","Store it cold":"Itago sa malamig","A sealed box in the fridge keeps the smell down until truck day.":"Sa saradong lalagyan sa ref, hindi ito babaho hanggang sa araw ng truck.","Since 1 Jan 2026 household food waste is no longer split. Pour it all into the blue food-waste bucket at the back of the garbage truck. The empty bag it came in goes in your general trash.":"Mula 1 Ene 2026, hindi na hinahati ang tirang pagkain ng bahay. Ibuhos lahat sa asul na balde ng tirang pagkain sa likod ng garbage truck. Ang walang lamang bag na pinaglagyan nito ay sa ordinaryong basura.","Leftover food, meat, bones":"Tirang pagkain, karne, buto","Drain the soup":"Patuluin ang sabaw","Drain it before you take it out.":"Patuluin bago ilabas.","Take off wrappers and bags":"Tanggalin ang balot at bag","Only the food goes in the bucket; wrappers and bags are general trash.":"Pagkain lang ang ilalagay sa balde; ordinaryong basura ang balot at bag.","Pour into the blue bucket":"Ibuhos sa asul na balde","At the back of the garbage truck. Follow the crew on the spot.":"Nasa likod ng garbage truck. Sundin ang crew doon.","Tea leaves / coffee grounds":"Dahon ng tsaa / giniling na kape","Remove the tea bag / filter":"Tanggalin ang tea bag / filter","The bag or filter paper goes in general trash.":"Sa ordinaryong basura ang tea bag o filter paper.","Batteries / power bank":"Battery / power bank","Pack them separately":"Ibalot nang hiwalay","Tape the ends":"Lagyan ng tape ang dulo","Cover the metal ends to prevent short circuits.":"Takpan ang metal na dulo para hindi mag-short circuit.","Never put batteries in the garbage bag, and never crush or take them apart.":"Huwag kailanman ilagay ang battery sa garbage bag, at huwag itong durugin o kalasin.","Pack it well, keep it apart from other recyclables, and hand it to the recycling crew (Mon, Tue, Thu, Fri, Sat). Never put it in the garbage bag.":"Ibalot nang maayos, ihiwalay sa ibang recyclable, at ibigay sa recycling crew (Lun, Mar, Huw, Biy, Sab). Huwag kailanman ilagay sa garbage bag.","Light bulb / fluorescent tube":"Bombilya / fluorescent tube","Pack it separately":"Ibalot nang hiwalay","Put it back in its box or wrap it in paper.":"Ibalik sa kahon nito o balutin sa papel.","Tubes contain mercury.":"May mercury ang fluorescent tube.","Used cooking oil":"Gamit na mantika","Pour into a bottle and cap it":"Ibuhos sa bote at takpan","Let it cool first.":"Palamigin muna.","Do not pour oil down the sink.":"Huwag ibuhos ang mantika sa lababo.","Spray / pressure can":"Spray / pressure can","Empty it outdoors":"Ubusin ang laman sa labas","Release what is left in an open area, or into something absorbent.":"Ilabas ang natitirang laman sa bukas na lugar, o sa bagay na sumisipsip.","Do not puncture, crush or burn a pressure can. Gas cylinders (瓦斯桶) go back to the shop that sold them.":"Huwag butasin, pipiin o sunugin ang pressure can. Ang tangke ng gas (瓦斯桶) ay ibinabalik sa tindahang nagbenta nito.","After emptying it, hand it to the recycling truck crew.":"Kapag ubos na ang laman, ibigay sa crew ng recycling truck.","Mercury thermometer / pesticide container":"Mercury thermometer / lalagyan ng pesticide","Pesticide containers: rinse 3 times":"Lalagyan ng pesticide: banlawan nang 3 beses","Bag it apart from other recyclables":"Ilagay sa bag na hiwalay sa ibang recyclable","Used tissues, diapers":"Gamit na tissue, diaper","Put it in an official bag":"Ilagay sa official bag","Up to the fill line, then tie it.":"Hanggang sa linya, saka itali.","Put it in a Taipei official garbage bag, tie it, and throw it into the garbage truck yourself.":"Ilagay sa official na garbage bag ng Taipei, itali, at ikaw mismo ang magtapon sa garbage truck.","Snack / chip bag":"Balot ng snack / chips","Dirty / oily plastic bag":"Marumi / may mantikang plastic bag","Straws, cup sealing film":"Straw, sealing film ng baso","Not in the current official list; older city leaflets say general trash.":"Wala sa kasalukuyang opisyal na listahan; sabi ng mas lumang leaflet ng lungsod, ordinaryong basura ito.","Wooden lunch box":"Kahoy na lunch box","Shoes":"Sapatos","Stuffed toy, balls":"Stuffed toy, bola","Towels, socks, bedding":"Tuwalya, medyas, kumot at sapin","Sticker backing, photo paper, glossy paper":"Likod ng sticker, photo paper, makintab na papel","Cigarette butts, dust":"Upos ng sigarilyo, alikabok","Not named in the official list; shown as general trash.":"Hindi nakapangalan sa opisyal na listahan; ipinapakita bilang ordinaryong basura.","Make sure it is out":"Siguraduhing patay na ang sindi","Expired medicine (pills)":"Expired na gamot (tableta)","Out of the blister, into a zip bag":"Alisin sa blister pack, ilagay sa zip bag","Mix with used tea leaves or coffee grounds":"Ihalo sa gamit na dahon ng tsaa o giniling na kape","So nobody can pick them out.":"Para walang makapulot o makakain nito.","Seal it and put it in general trash":"Isara nang mabuti at itapon sa ordinaryong basura","Do not pour medicine down the sink or toilet. Special medicines (e.g. anti-cancer drugs) go back to a hospital or pharmacy.":"Huwag ibuhos ang gamot sa lababo o inidoro. Ang espesyal na gamot (hal. gamot sa cancer) ay ibinabalik sa ospital o botika.","Broken bowls, plates, ceramics":"Basag na mangkok, plato, ceramic","Wrap it in newspaper":"Balutin sa diyaryo","So the crew does not get cut.":"Para hindi masugatan ang crew.","Write \"broken\" on it":"Isulat ang \"basag\" dito","Ceramics are not recyclable but cannot be burned, so they go to the recycling truck, wrapped.":"Hindi nire-recycle ang ceramic pero hindi rin puwedeng sunugin, kaya ibinibigay ito sa recycling truck nang nakabalot.","Hand it to the recycling truck crew, wrapped.":"Ibigay sa crew ng recycling truck nang nakabalot.","Broken glass":"Basag na salamin","We could not find a current official rule for broken glass.":"Wala kaming nahanap na kasalukuyang opisyal na patakaran para sa basag na salamin.","Wrap it safely":"Balutin nang ligtas","Wrap it in thick paper and write \"broken glass\" on it, so nobody gets cut.":"Balutin sa makapal na papel at isulat ang \"basag na salamin\" dito, para walang masugatan.","We could not find an official rule for this item. Call your district cleaning squad or 1999 before throwing it out.":"Wala kaming nahanap na opisyal na patakaran para sa bagay na ito. Tawagan ang cleaning squad ng district mo o 1999 bago ito itapon.","Sofa, mattress, furniture, bicycle":"Sofa, kutson, muwebles, bisikleta","Book first":"Mag-book muna","Call your district cleaning squad or 1999 at least one day before. Tell them your address and the items; they set the day, time and place.":"Tawagan ang cleaning squad ng district mo o 1999 kahit isang araw bago. Sabihin ang address mo at ang mga gamit; sila ang magtatakda ng araw, oras at lugar.","Put it out as agreed":"Ilabas ayon sa napagkasunduan","Usually after 9 pm on the agreed day. Do not add items you did not book.":"Karaniwang pagkalipas ng 9 pm sa napagkasunduang araw. Huwag magdagdag ng gamit na hindi mo na-book.","Do not leave furniture on the street without booking. Households only — shops and companies arrange their own.":"Huwag iwan ang muwebles sa kalye nang walang booking. Para sa mga bahay lang — ang mga tindahan at kumpanya ang bahala sa sarili nila.","TV, fridge, washer, A/C, range hood":"TV, ref, washing machine, aircon, range hood","Call your district cleaning squad or 1999 at least one day before.":"Tawagan ang cleaning squad ng district mo o 1999 kahit isang araw bago.","Buy official garbage bags":"Bumili ng official na garbage bag","General trash must go in a Taipei City official garbage bag (New Taipei bags are accepted too). Sizes 3 L–120 L, e.g. 14 L: NT$100 for 20 bags, or NT$5 for one retail bag. See \"Official garbage bags\" for sizes and where to buy.":"Ang ordinaryong basura ay dapat nasa official na garbage bag ng Taipei City (tinatanggap din ang bag ng New Taipei). Laki 3 L–120 L, hal. 14 L: NT$100 para sa 20 bag, o NT$5 para sa isang bag. Tingnan ang \"Official na garbage bag\" para sa laki at kung saan bibili.","Recycling, food waste and bulky-waste pickup are free — no special bag needed.":"Libre ang recycling, tirang pagkain at pickup ng malalaking basura — hindi kailangan ng espesyal na bag.","Not using an official bag can be fined from NT$1,200 (Waste Disposal Act).":"Puwedeng multahan mula NT$1,200 kapag hindi gumamit ng official bag (Waste Disposal Act).","Sort at home into 3":"Paghiwalayin sa bahay sa 3 grupo","1. General trash (official bag)  2. Recycling (any bag)  3. Food waste (a box or bag).":"1. Ordinaryong basura (official bag)  2. Recycling (kahit anong bag)  3. Tirang pagkain (lalagyan o bag).","Not sure? Use \"What is this item?\" on the home page.":"Hindi sigurado? Gamitin ang \"Ano ang basurang ito?\" sa home page.","Check the day":"Alamin ang araw","No collection on Wednesday and Sunday. Suggested days for recycling: paper & clothes Mon / Fri; bottles, cans & plastics Tue / Thu / Sat. Sorted recyclables are still accepted on the other collection days.":"Walang koleksyon tuwing Miyerkules at Linggo. Mungkahing araw para sa recycling: papel at damit Lun / Biy; bote, lata at plastik Mar / Huw / Sab. Tinatanggap pa rin ang naka-sort na recyclable sa ibang araw ng koleksyon.","Lunar New Year has a special schedule announced by the Department of Environmental Protection.":"May espesyal na iskedyul tuwing Lunar New Year na inaanunsyo ng Department of Environmental Protection.","Find your stop and time":"Hanapin ang hintuan at oras mo","The truck stops at fixed places at fixed times, usually only a few minutes. Arrive 5 minutes early.":"Humihinto ang truck sa takdang lugar at oras, kadalasan ilang minuto lang. Dumating nang 5 minutong mas maaga.","Missed it? The city runs limited-time drop-off points in every district.":"Hindi naabutan? May drop-off point na bukas sa takdang oras ang lungsod sa bawat district.","Listen for the music":"Pakinggan ang tugtog","Trucks play music as they come (often \"Für Elise\"). A recycling truck runs on the same route.":"Nagpapatugtog ang truck habang parating (kadalasan \"Für Elise\"). May recycling truck din sa parehong ruta.","Hand it over yourself":"Ikaw mismo ang mag-abot","Throw the official bag into the garbage truck. Give recyclables to the recycling crew. Pour food waste into the blue bucket at the back of the truck.":"Itapon ang official bag sa garbage truck. Ibigay ang recyclable sa recycling crew. Ibuhos ang tirang pagkain sa asul na balde sa likod ng truck.","Never leave trash on the street or by a pole — Taipei has no curbside bins. You can be fined.":"Huwag kailanman iwan ang basura sa kalye o sa tabi ng poste — walang basurahan sa gilid ng kalye sa Taipei. Puwede kang multahan.","Big bone":"Malaking buto","Eggshell":"Balat ng itlog","Seashell":"Kabibe","Dirty styrofoam":"Maruming styrofoam","Toothbrush":"Toothbrush","Lighter":"Lighter","Needle, syringe":"Karayom, syringe","CD / DVD disc":"CD / DVD","Tire":"Gulong","Cassette, video tape":"Cassette, video tape","Doormat, carpet":"Doormat, carpet","Sponge, foam padding":"Sponge, foam","Whiteboard":"Whiteboard","Inner tube":"Interior ng gulong","Scooter body panel, seat":"Body panel at upuan ng scooter","Lubricant oil":"Lubricant oil","Pens, combs and small items":"Ballpen, suklay at maliliit na gamit"};
